flowchart TD
  START[Workflow not green] --> GRAPH[Inspect graph]
  GRAPH --> FIRST[Open first failed step]
  FIRST --> KIND{Symptom}
  KIND -->|missing artifact| ART[Compare upload and download name]
  KIND -->|empty output| OUT[Compare step id and output mapping]
  KIND -->|wrong job order| NEEDS[Check needs]
  KIND -->|unexpected skip| COND[Check condition and upstream result]
  ART --> FIX[Repair one issue and rerun]
  OUT --> FIX
  NEEDS --> FIX
  COND --> FIX
